<title>USA: QUIDEL names Andre de Bruin vice chairman.</title>
<headline>QUIDEL names Andre de Bruin vice chairman.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>QUIDEL Corp said Wednesday it had named Andre de Bruin vice chairman of the company and had elected him to the board of directors.</p>
<p>De Bruin currently serves as chairman, president and chief executive of Somatogen Inc.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman for the company said that there had been no vice chairman position prior to this appointment.</p>
</text>
